{"ordinal":9305,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495307","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_0b92381","source":"Поезжай к сестре. Она не откажет тебе в помощи","target":"Mergi la sora ta. Nu-ți va refuza ajutorul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9306,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495306","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_04c4656","source":"Bestson: Боже, почему…","target":"Bestson: Doamne, de ce…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9307,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495305","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_0a0b65e","source":"Bestson: Боже, клянусь, я бы всё отдал, чтобы ещё раз увидеть моих маму и папу.","target":"Bestson: Doamne, jur că aș da orice ca să-i mai văd o dată pe mama și pe tata.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9308,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495304","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_009dd10","source":"Bestson: Они правда оставили меня.","target":"Bestson: Chiar m-au lăsat în urmă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9309,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495303","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_08e4169","source":"Bestson: …","target":"Bestson: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9310,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495302","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_033605a","source":"Bestson: Произошло то, о чём я рассказывал на пороге. Телевизор, родители в панике, а потом…","target":"Bestson: S-a întâmplat ce ți-am povestit la ușă. Televizorul, părinții panicați, apoi…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9311,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495301","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_07c001c","source":"Bestson: А затем, на следующий день…","target":"Bestson: Iar a doua zi…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9312,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495300","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_0317018","source":"Bestson: Я очень сильно рассердился на них и пошёл к себе в комнату. Хотел, чтобы они оставили меня в покое.","target":"Bestson: M-am înfuriat foarte tare pe ei și m-am dus în camera mea. Voiam să mă lase în pace.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9313,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495299","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_0edb6c2","source":"Bestson: Когда родители рассказали мне правду, я почувствовал, что меня обманывали всё это время.","target":"Bestson: Când părinții mi-au spus adevărul, am simțit că mă mințiseră tot timpul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9314,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495298","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_4_0d04b5f","source":"Bestson: Я её почти не знаю.","target":"Bestson: Abia dacă o cunosc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-240.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9315,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495297","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_4_040cf32","source":"Мне нужно тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-005.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9316,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454749495296","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_4_042b73d","source":"Почему ты не хочешь поехать к сестре?","target":"De ce nu vrei să mergi la sora ta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9317,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745301003","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_4_041d16b","source":"Bestson: Охх… Где же мои родители…","target":"Bestson: Of… Unde or fi părinții mei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9318,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745301002","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0f86595","source":"Bestson: Просто… скажи ей, что я есть. Что не знаю, что мне делать.","target":"Bestson: Doar… spune-i că exist. Că nu știu ce să fac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9319,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745301001","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0f27b90","source":"Bestson: Может, ты мог бы позвонить ей за меня?.. Вот номер – {0}.","target":"Bestson: Poate ai putea s-o suni în locul meu?.. Uite numărul – {0}.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9320,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745301000","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_06828d8","source":"Bestson: Я… наверное, был бы рад с ней поговорить. Но не решаюсь.","target":"Bestson: Eu… cred că mi-ar plăcea să vorbesc cu ea. Dar nu am curaj.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9321,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300999","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0ceab45","source":"Bestson: Вот, вроде, моя «сестра», но для меня она совершенно незнакомый человек... так странно…","target":"Bestson: E „sora” mea, dar pentru mine e o străină... e atât de ciudat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9322,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300998","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_02979db","source":"Bestson: От услышанного я… очень странно себя чувствовал. Не понимал, что происходит.","target":"Bestson: Când am auzit asta, m-am… simțit foarte ciudat. Nu înțelegeam ce se întâmplă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9323,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300997","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0102e0b","source":"Bestson: Только не родная. У нас с ней общий папа.","target":"Bestson: Dar nu e sora mea bună. Avem același tată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9324,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300996","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0154025","source":"Bestson: Он рассказал мне, что на самом деле я не первый его ребёнок. У меня всё это время была сестра…","target":"Bestson: Tata mi-a spus că, de fapt, nu sunt primul lui copil. Și, în tot acest timp, aveam o soră…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9325,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300995","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_093c1f3","source":"Bestson: Честно говоря, я сперва не поверил, подумал, это какой-то розыгрыш. Но ведь его мне дал папа.","target":"Bestson: Sincer, la început n-am crezut. M-am gândit că e o farsă. Dar scrisoarea mi-o dăduse tata.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9326,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300994","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0befea8","source":"Bestson: В письме она писала, что хотела бы познакомиться со мной. Но… Я не знал, что и думать.","target":"Bestson: În scrisoare spunea că ar vrea să mă cunoască. Dar… eu nu știam ce să cred.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9327,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300993","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0a85b75","source":"Bestson: Оно было от «сестры».","target":"Bestson: Era de la „sora” mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9328,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454745300992","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_034ec3e","source":"Bestson: Мне его принёс папа, потому что я не хожу проверять почту. Он сказал почитать его.","target":"Bestson: Mi-a adus-o tata, fiindcă eu nu verific niciodată poșta. Mi-a spus s-o citesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9329,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106699","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_048f0c6","source":"Bestson: Незадолго до того, как родители уехали, нам пришло письмо.","target":"Bestson: Cu puțin înainte să plece părinții, am primit o scrisoare.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9330,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106698","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0930409","source":"Bestson: …","target":"Bestson: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9331,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106697","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_3_0903b46","source":"Bestson: Ну, я…","target":"Bestson: Păi, eu…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9332,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106696","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_3_01fb214","source":"Мне нужно тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-005.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9333,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106695","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_3_055f060","source":"Ты успокоился? Что за сестра?","target":"Te-ai liniștit? Despre ce soră vorbeai?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9334,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106694","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_3_0ec7087","source":"Bestson: Охх… Где же мои родители…","target":"Bestson: Of… Unde or fi părinții mei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9335,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106693","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_0d177ef","source":"Bestson: …","target":"Bestson: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106692","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_027669c","source":"Bestson: Я ПРОПАДУ БЕЗ НИХ. ПОЧЕМУ ОНИ НЕ ВЗЯЛИ МЕНЯ С СОБОЙ?","target":"Bestson: FĂRĂ EI SUNT PIERDUT. DE CE NU M-AU LUAT CU EI?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9337,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106691","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_0289c4c","source":"Bestson: Боже, почему? Почему они не остались? Почему они не взяли меня с собой? ПОЧЕМУ…","target":"Bestson: Doamne, de ce? De ce n-au rămas? De ce nu m-au luat cu ei? DE CE…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9338,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106690","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_0b65628","source":"Bestson: А что, если бабушка оказалась Гостем и убила их? Что, если КЧС их остановили и забрали…","target":"Bestson: Dar dacă bunica a devenit Musafir și i-a ucis? Dacă i-a oprit Comitetul și i-a luat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9339,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106689","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_083c515","source":"Bestson: Боже, кажется, теперь я понял, куда родители уезжали…","target":"Bestson: Doamne, cred că mi-am dat seama unde au plecat părinții…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9340,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454741106688","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_0d0d71e","source":"Bestson: Чёрт, моя бабушка!","target":"Bestson: La naiba, bunica mea!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9341,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912396","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_0f468ea","source":"Bestson: …","target":"Bestson: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9342,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912395","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_0a8f723","source":"Bestson: Недавно узнал о старшей сестре от первого брака папы, но…","target":"Bestson: Am aflat de curând că am o soră mai mare din prima căsătorie a tatei, dar…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9343,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912394","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_2_08de0da","source":"Bestson: Почти никого. Хотя…","target":"Bestson: Aproape pe nimeni. Deși…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9344,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912393","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_2_0662c74","source":"Мне нужно тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-005.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9345,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912392","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_2_03044b5","source":"У тебя есть какие-нибудь другие родственники?","target":"Mai ai și alte rude?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9346,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912391","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_2_0f1b69e","source":"Bestson: Охх… Где же мои родители…","target":"Bestson: Of… Unde or fi părinții mei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9347,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912390","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_1_00f305d","source":"Bestson: Надеюсь, они в порядке. Не представляю себя без них…","target":"Bestson: Sper că sunt bine. Nu-mi pot imagina viața fără ei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9348,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912389","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_1_01874c1","source":"Bestson: Они заботились обо мне всю жизнь, но теперь… даже не знаю, что с ними произошло.","target":"Bestson: Au avut grijă de mine toată viața, iar acum… nici măcar nu știu ce li s-a întâmplat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9349,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912388","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Asking_1_08442b0","source":"Bestson: Не знаю… Очень хочу, чтобы родители всё же вернулись.","target":"Bestson: Nu știu… Îmi doresc tare mult să se întoarcă totuși.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-241.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9350,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454736912387","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_bestson_1_07ac9f2","source":"Мне нужно тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-005.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
